        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_eating_ones_words_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He fuses big strength Gu with defecate Gu into big strength defecate Gu. That product is rank three, looks similar, and has the same purpose at three times the strength, but costs more food and is less popular than the rank two Gu. Misuse can kill through excessive diarrhoea. A lion roar Gu image then eats the big strength defecate Gu as part of refining temporary eating one’s words Gu.",
        "chapters": [
